  },
  {
   "shot": 121,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "At 6 AM, open the curtains again, and say \"Good morning, house.\"",
     "start": 761.325,
     "end": 765.644
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 122,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Your phone alarm goes off at 5:59 AM.",
     "start": 766.505,
     "end": 768.892
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 123,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Gray light is leaking around the edges of the curtains.",
     "start": 769.773,
     "end": 773.561
    },
    {
     "text": "You stand up.",
     "start": 774.309,
     "end": 775.21
    },
    {
     "text": "Your legs are stiff.",
     "start": 775.951,
     "end": 776.781
    },
    {
     "text": "Your neck hurts.",
     "start": 777.489,
     "end": 778.575
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 124,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You start with the kitchen, the way the list said.",
     "start": 779.099,
     "end": 782.573
    },
    {
     "text": "You pull the curtains open, and the sunrise pours in, pink and gold, across the backyard.",
     "start": 783.121,
     "end": 788.156
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 125,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The grass is covered in frost.",
     "start": 789.677,
     "end": 791.521
    },
    {
     "text": "And the frost is covered in footprints.",
     "start": 792.393,
     "end": 794.785
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 126,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Hundreds of them.",
     "start": 795.822,
     "end": 796.522
    },
    {
     "text": "Circling the house again and again.",
     "start": 797.082,
     "end": 799.218
    },
    {
     "text": "Paw prints that turn into bare feet halfway across the lawn.",
     "start": 800.304,
     "end": 803.876
    },
    {
     "text": "Long, thin feet with too many toes.",
     "start": 804.826,
     "end": 808.261
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 127,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "They all lead back into the corn.",
     "start": 809.289,
     "end": 811.189
    },
    {
     "text": "None of them lead inside.",
     "start": 812.046,
     "end": 813.475
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 128,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You open every curtain.",
     "start": 814.906,
     "end": 816.256
    },
    {
     "text": "All nine windows downstairs.",
     "start": 816.849,
     "end": 818.674
    },
    {
     "text": "The house fills up with sunlight.",
     "start": 819.598,
     "end": 821.174
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 129,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Then you stand in the middle of the kitchen, feeling a little bit silly, and you say it out loud.",
     "start": 822.293,
     "end": 827.565
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Good morning, house.\"",
     "start": 828.702,
     "end": 829.642
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 130,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Somewhere deep inside the walls, the old pipes knock.",
     "start": 831.303,
     "end": 834.674
    },
    {
     "text": "Twice.",
     "start": 835.508,
     "end": 835.894
    },
    {
     "text": "Soft and gentle.",
     "start": 836.637,
     "end": 838.0
    },
    {
     "text": "Like someone saying, good morning back.",
     "start": 839.052,
     "end": 841.933
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 131,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "At 8:05 AM, a car crunches up the gravel road.",
     "start": 842.495,
     "end": 845.906
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 132,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Buster bursts out of the back seat before it even stops, and knocks you flat on the porch, licking your face.",
     "start": 846.945,
     "end": 852.837
    },
    {
     "text": "He's warm and real and smells like dog.",
     "start": 853.539,
     "end": 856.486
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 133,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Mom runs to you.",
     "start": 857.553,
     "end": 858.817
    },
    {
     "text": "She hugs you so hard you can't breathe.",
     "start": 859.562,
     "end": 861.42
    },
    {
     "text": "She's crying, and laughing, and crying again.",
     "start": 862.064,
     "end": 864.413
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 134,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"Did you follow the list?\" she whispers.",
     "start": 865.585,
     "end": 867.623
    },
    {
     "text": "\"All of it?\"",
     "start": 868.212,
     "end": 868.719
    },
    {
     "text": "You nod.",
     "start": 869.811,
     "end": 870.271
    },
    {
     "text": "Then you tell her about the phone call.",
     "start": 871.242,
     "end": 872.849
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 135,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Mom goes very still.",
     "start": 873.837,
     "end": 875.224
    },
    {
     "text": "She doesn't say anything for a long time.",
     "start": 876.113,
     "end": 877.834
    },
    {
     "text": "Then she opens her wallet and pulls out a folded piece of paper.",
     "start": 878.664,
     "end": 882.474
    },
    {
     "text": "It's soft and yellow, worn thin from being folded and unfolded a thousand times.",
     "start": 883.313,
     "end": 888.735
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 136,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "She hands it to you.",
     "start": 889.638,
     "end": 890.452
    },
    {
     "text": "It's a list.",
     "start": 891.405,
     "end": 891.982
    },
    {
     "text": "Rules for your first night alone.",
     "start": 893.007,
     "end": 894.822
    },
    {
     "text": "Same five rules.",
     "start": 895.839,
     "end": 896.932
    },
    {
     "text": "Same loopy, old-fashioned handwriting.",
     "start": 897.478,
     "end": 899.463
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 137,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "At the bottom, there's a date.",
     "start": 900.486,
     "end": 903.425
    },
    {
     "text": "October 1991.",
     "start": 903.7,
     "end": 904.771
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 138,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"I was twelve,\" Mom says quietly.",
     "start": 905.87,
     "end": 907.978
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Your grandma wrote that for me.",
     "start": 908.692,
     "end": 909.947
    },
    {
     "text": "My first night alone in this house.\"",
     "start": 910.581,
     "end": 911.958
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 139,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "She looks at the beige phone on the kitchen wall.",
     "start": 913.035,
     "end": 915.053
    },
    {
     "text": "\"She called me too,\" she says.",
     "start": 916.116,
     "end": 917.787
    },
    {
     "text": "\"At 12:30.",
     "start": 918.555,
     "end": 919.173
    },
    {
     "text": "And her mother called her.\"",
     "start": 920.205,
     "end": 921.251
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 140,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Mom wipes her eyes and smiles.",
     "start": 922.653,
     "end": 924.362
    },
    {
     "text": "\"This house has been watching over our family for a hundred years,\" she says.",
     "start": 925.366,
     "end": 928.993
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Those things out there have been trying to get in for just as long.",
     "start": 929.488,
     "end": 933.437
    },
    {
     "text": "The house keeps them out.",
     "start": 934.28,
     "end": 935.59
    },
    {
     "text": "It just needs us to take care of it, too.\"",
     "start": 936.384,
     "end": 938.754
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 141,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "That night, after everyone's asleep, you creep down to the kitchen in your socks.",
     "start": 939.816,
     "end": 945.269
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 142,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "You put your hand flat on the wall.",
     "start": 946.082,
     "end": 948.232
    },
    {
     "text": "It's warm, like always.",
     "start": 948.901,
     "end": 950.495
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Thank you,\" you whisper.",
     "start": 951.568,
     "end": 953.093
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 143,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The kitchen light flickers twice.",
     "start": 954.086,
     "end": 955.794
    },
    {
     "text": "You know what it means.",
     "start": 956.607,
     "end": 957.678
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 144,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Someday, a long time from now, you'll have a kid of your own.",
     "start": 958.511,
     "end": 962.575
    },
    {
     "text": "And one night, you'll have to leave them here alone.",
     "start": 963.237,
     "end": 965.97
    },
    {
     "text": "And you'll sit at this kitchen table, and you'll write the list.",
     "start": 966.861,
     "end": 970.367
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 145,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Five rules.",
     "start": 971.106,
     "end": 971.977
    },
    {
     "text": "In your neatest handwriting.",
     "start": 972.543,
     "end": 974.012
    },
    {
     "text": "And at the bottom, you'll add one more line, just for them.",
     "start": 974.886,
     "end": 978.434
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 146,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The house will take care of you.",
     "start": 979.38,
     "end": 980.93
    },
    {
     "text": "As long as you take care of it.",
     "start": 981.757,
     "end": 983.801
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 147,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Goodnight, house.",
     "start": 984.596,
     "end": 985.447
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 148,
   "sentences": []
  }
 ]
}